# oracle: create_atoms box on an orthogonal block box with boundary f f f and an inexact lattice spacing (fcc 4.5937 metal, box 0 3 0 3 0 2 lattice units); atom counts and positions by ID
# Measured with native LAMMPS: 72 atoms (fcc 4.5937, 3x3x2 cells), the same count as the engine before and after the fix; a regression guard for the orthogonal block with boundary f f f.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
dimension       3
boundary        f f f
lattice         fcc 4.5937
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 2 units lattice
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 63.546
pair_style      zero 5.0
pair_coeff      * *
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
